  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering education for peace and global citizenship</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the framework of the 2023 Recommendation, UNESCO will support education that promotes peace, global citizenship, and respect for diversity. It will work through two complementary pillars. The first strengthens the implementation of the Recommendation and helps countries integrate global citizenship education into their education systems. The second builds on this foundation by addressing key themes, including hate speech, antisemitism, racism and other forms of discrimination, learning about histories of violence, responsible participation in digital spaces, culture and arts education, the GHA, and social and emotional learning. Deliverables include guidance, capacity-strengthening activities, knowledge resources, and tools to support educators and policymakers.</narrative>
  </description>
